<title>INDONESIA: Indocement 9-mth net slightly up.</title>
<headline>Indocement 9-mth net slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>				   (in billion rupiah, unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net revenue			     3,188.74 vs 2,880.16</p>
<p>    Gross profit			    1,158.03 vs 1,055.15</p>
<p>    Operating profit			  834.47 vs   768.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income			    621.76 vs   543.33</p>
<p>    Net profit				  389.46 vs   322.10</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		     1,420.67 vs 1,028.25</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	   161 vs	133</p>
<p>Note : The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Indocement Tunggal Prakarsa currently is the largest cement producer in Indonesia. Founded in 1985 under the name of PT Distinct Indocement Enterprise, the company is a member of the Salim Group.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
